WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
After all, it’s just a fight between disciples.

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:05,600
What do we say when we, as elders, intervene?

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:07,000
You want to be whipped too

4
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,400
This matter still needs to be decided by the two sect leaders.

5
00:00:13,780 --> 00:00:15,380
Wang Zhi violates the rules and returns home

6
00:00:15,380 --> 00:00:16,780
According to sect regulations

7
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,980
After deposing Lord Ling, he was expelled from the sect.

8
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:20,580
Never return to the Red Xiao Sect again

9
00:00:20,580 --> 00:00:22,180
The two sect leaders think twice

10
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:24,380
He's just a fourth-term Ling Lord.

11
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:25,980
Although my Chixiao Sect is not big,

12
00:00:25,980 --> 00:00:27,980
But there are also hundreds of four Ling Lords

13
00:00:27,980 --> 00:00:30,580
Which one of them is like Wang Zhi who violates the rules of the family?

14
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,580
Talk about harming fellow disciples but

15
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:34,780
She just wanted someone else's life

16
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:36,380
It just invalidates her qualifications as the Ling Lord

17
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:38,380
Not having a long life is already good

18
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:39,850
Elder Wang

19
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:41,250
You don't know how to teach

20
00:00:41,250 --> 00:00:42,450
No punishment for you

21
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:44,650
It's because you were just born and became an elder.

22
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:48,360
Do you understand

23
00:00:48,360 --> 00:00:52,280
I’ll tell you if I’m wrong.
